@startuml

title UC6 - Consultar Empréstimos

actor User
participant ":System" as System

User -> System: consultarEmprestimosAtivos()
activate System

    System -> System: buscarEmprestimos()

    System -> System: processarListaDeEmprestimos(emprestimos)

    System --> User: mostrarListaDeEmprestimos()
deactivate System

@enduml